Package: marlinraker-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Junior Tada <juniortada@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: docker.io | docker-ce, docker-compose-v2 | docker-compose-plugin, xdg-utils
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/juniortada/marlinraker
Description: Marlinraker and Mainsail for USB Marlin printers in OrcaSlicer
 Runs Marlinraker with the Mainsail web interface in Docker, so OrcaSlicer
 can send prints to a Marlin printer connected by USB as if it were an
 OctoPrint host at localhost:7125. The "OrcaSlicer + Marlinraker" menu entry
 starts the server and opens the OrcaSlicer installed on the computer.
